{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9ed3625089485b59cdc9e18477e976b96e5bf313278ecc38a534d8c2fb4ea3fc", "ja": "（今日はコスプレグラビア企画の撮影日。なのだが……\n可奈が控室にいったきり、なかなか戻ってこない）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄Cosplay写真企划的日子。可是……\n可奈去了休息室之后，一直都没有回来）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "ee5839ab59293b1aedf5e07abc27957cd3472609554eadcf5426c76afbeaaf6b", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　ちょっとだけ控室に\n行ってきていいですか？　すぐ戻りま～す！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！　我可以去一下\n休息室吗？　马上就回～来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b0a23bbf8b8c12f6c968d156b126967b31803c263f358026013680e068c6530c", "ja": "本番まで時間はあるが……。\n少し心配だな。一応、様子を見に行ってみるか。", "zh": "距离正式演出还有时间，不过……\n还是有点担心。总之，去看看情况吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "f3bfba9b9face8c92eb14140a8d6146223f44313256b7b7e84231cace6ddddf9", "ja": "ネコさん、ネコさん、こんにちは～♪\n今日から可奈も、仲間だにゃ～ん♪", "zh": "猫咪，猫咪，你好呀～♪\n从今天开始，可奈也是伙伴了喵～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1004_se", "source_sha256": "17b7d4465251f58898169f5fde71a4781937a5ef4054f5e5b5b9b0a979e7e786", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャッ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ae60af0c1dea49a6a473f612f33969d67b863f3c87b685e5650ecbba70717f15", "ja": "可奈、入るぞー……。", "zh": "可奈，我进来了——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "0624906a3b9635a82f78a72cfcc2e6f629a367f0573c3652839e5e30ec2d734d", "ja": "これで可奈も～、ネコ集会ー……はわっ！？\n{$P$}さん！？", "zh": "这样可奈也能参加～猫咪聚会——啊哇！？  \n{$P$}先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "3ca73f08c5c3216c2b143e447513ae97da8fa0d7c145ac20846ea1911c56bc1f", "ja": "って、もう時間ですか！？\n歌に夢中で、全然時計を見てませんでした……。", "zh": "咦，已经到时间了吗！？\n我太专注于唱歌，完全没看时间……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1008_p", "source_sha256": "064c3a0d19c67f059f439eecec0bd28c1f7288e4e6c3c95029a29574c7b23ca5", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。本番まで、まだ余裕があるからな。\nしかし、時間がかかってるけど、問題でもあったのか？", "zh": "没事的。距离正式开演还有富余的时间呢。\n不过，花了这么长时间，是出什么问题了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "b8e9f98d5c8c23655a8f457fb189d8b5205e1ab9fb13620937655c4786bce473", "ja": "えっ！？　あっ、えっと……問題とかはなくて……。\nその……鏡を見てたら、ちょっと思いついちゃって。", "zh": "诶！？啊，那个……没什么问题……  \n只是……照着镜子的时候，突然想到了一点东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ccd4df5cca5ae68500dbe5977c6c1327a3b6b150ddd23c2cd17db5a4089ccd87", "ja": "思いついた？", "zh": "想到了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "515bcdaf10df98fdebbbfd9d310d03b3661e20d092996ada59b1b444bf270129", "ja": "はい。……この衣装なら、ネコの集会に行っても\n逃げないでくれるかなーって……。", "zh": "是的……我在想，穿着这身服装去参加猫咪的集会，它们会不会就不逃跑了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d8b6969faa79369ab0de857e16a5b3678564f4d938d5a93521d84f969bc8c298", "ja": "ネコの、集会……。", "zh": "猫咪的集会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "a0dca3a16ff63184570a608166388e37eaf85edb6cbaa6d5c01b9b2b97519b12", "ja": "そうです。いつも逃げられちゃうんですけど。これなら\n仲間だと思って、逃げないんじゃないかなって。", "zh": "是的。虽然它们总是会逃走，但这样一来，它们应该会把我当成同伴，不再逃跑了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b3523c5b554768b0318fd9ee0db735486fe4a736d07554cd1cf842bc20ecb4f6", "ja": "なるほど……？", "zh": "原来如此……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "734e1be42f0cebc08de43714d784a6bca443c769ffa5a8a8e672afdc3e00fa3c", "ja": "そして、私と一緒に歌ってくれるんです！\nニャーニャー、ミーミー♪　ネコと一緒に大合唱～♪", "zh": "而且，还会和我一起唱歌！\n喵喵、咪咪♪ 和猫咪一起大合唱～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "3c2e219095ec6b9490dac1f6f585a2a3047b9d36a47eae5156ef32826d400be0", "ja": "だからお願いします！　この衣装、一日だけ貸して\nもらえませんか？　私、ネコ集会に行きたいんです！", "zh": "所以拜托了！这套服装能借给我一天吗？我想去参加猫咪聚会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4f55a0312133815f8154bf3cb4da58ec40b97ffad11158977df3750d32a78a95", "ja": "はは、わかったよ。それなら……今日の撮影が\nうまくいったら、借りれるように聞いてみるよ。", "zh": "哈哈，知道了。那样的话……今天的拍摄要是顺利，我就帮你问问能不能借来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0593_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "d551895e0fcf14bafec8f1b61aabd7fc3c23e182bf76ffc6e5f3442f02eb6619", "ja": "えっ、ホントですか！？　やったー！\nにゃんにゃんにゃーん、可奈にゃんこ頑張りま～す♪", "zh": "诶，真的吗！？太好啦！\n喵喵喵——可奈喵会加油的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
